    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d197">

                <pb facs="0285" n="201" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg201"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72115/3379</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stovall</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-10-02T15:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 2, 1918, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3047. Your despatch 4437, September 10, 1918. Department assumes that you will
                    draw attention of Austro-Hungarian authorities <pb facs="0286" n="202"
                        xml:id="pg202"/> through Spanish Embassy, Vienna, to inaccuracy of its
                    statement, illustrating your point by citing certain pertinent cases.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
